        "text": "Page: Dan Balan. Sentence: He is the first and only Moldovan musician to be nominated for a Grammy as co-writer of Rihanna and T.I.'s \"Live Your Life\".\nPage: Live Your Life (T.I. song). Sentence: \"Live Your Life\" is a song by American rapper T.I., from his sixth studio album, \"Paper Trail\" (2008), and features Barbadian singer Rihanna.\nPage: O-Zone. Sentence: O-Zone is a Moldovan pop music trio that was active from 1998 to 2005 and consisted of Dan Balan, Radu Sîrbu, and Arsenie Todiraș.\nPage: Numa Numa (video). Sentence: Numa Numa is an Internet meme based on a video by American vlogger Gary Brolsma made after the song \"Dragostea Din Tei\" as performed by O-Zone.",
